## Attribution

This codebase is used in **Brown University CSCI 2470: Deep Learning (Fall 2026)**.

It is adapted from the [minllama-assignment](https://github.com/neubig/minllama-assignment)
by Vijay Viswanathan, developed for Carnegie Mellon University's CS11-711 Advanced NLP
(Graham Neubig), which is based in turn on
[minbert-assignment](https://github.com/neubig/minbert-assignment).

The underlying model code derives from [llama2.c](https://github.com/karpathy/llama2.c)
by Andrej Karpathy (MIT License, above). `tokenizer.py` additionally carries a notice from
Meta Platforms, Inc. and is subject to the Llama 2 Community License Agreement. Parts of
`config.py` and `utils.py` are adapted from the Hugging Face
[`transformers`](https://github.com/huggingface/transformers) library (Apache License 2.0).

### Changes made for CSCI 2470
- Course-context headers added to source files; all original attribution retained
- `setup.sh` updated for the Brown course environment
